  "preamble": "Shift of a voiced retroflex affricate [ɖ͡ʐ] to the postalveolar affricate [d͡ʒ], moving the tongue tip from a curled retroflex position to a domed postalveolar one. It is documented in Kartvelian, where Proto-Kartvelian *ʒ₁ (reconstructed as [ɖ͡ʐ] in the Gamkrelidze-Machavariani system) became ǯ [d͡ʒ] in Mingrelian, Laz and Svan, while Georgian merged it with plain ʒ [d͡z].",
  "phoneticEffects": "Deretroflexion, Merger",
  "languageExamples": [
    {
      "language": "Proto-Kartvelian to Mingrelian and Laz",
      "languageFamily": "Zan",
      "examples": [
        {
          "from": "Proto-Kartvelian *ʒ₁am- 'brother' (Old Georgian ძმაჲ ʒmay)",
          "to": "Mingrelian ჯიმა ǯima, Laz ჯუმა ǯuma"
        },
        {
          "from": "Proto-Kartvelian *ʒ₁aɣl- 'dog' (Old Georgian ძაღლი ʒaɣli)",
          "to": "Laz, Mingrelian ჯოღორი ǯoɣori"
        },
        {
          "from": "Proto-Kartvelian *ʒ₁arɣw- 'vein' (Old Georgian ძარღჳ ʒarɣw)",
          "to": "Mingrelian ჯერღვი ǯerɣvi"
        },
        {
          "from": "Proto-Georgian-Zan *ʒ₁ir- 'root, bottom' (Old Georgian ძირი ʒiri)",
          "to": "Laz ჯიჯი ǯiǯi, Mingrelian ჯინჯი ǯinǯi"
        },
        {
          "from": "Proto-Georgian-Zan *ʒ₁ixe- 'fortress'",
          "to": "Laz, Mingrelian ჯიხა ǯixa",
          "note": "ǯ is the Kartvelological transcription of [d͡ʒ]. Wiktionary's subscript-1 series (*s₁, *z₁, *c₁, *ʒ₁) is the Gamkrelidze-Machavariani 'hissing-hushing' series, given in the Wikipedia Proto-Kartvelian consonant table (after Gamkrelidze 1966 and Fähnrich 2002) as retroflex [ʂ ʐ ʈ͡ʂ ɖ͡ʐ]."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "language": "Proto-Kartvelian to Svan",
      "languageFamily": "Svan",
      "examples": [
        {
          "from": "Proto-Kartvelian *ʒ₁am- 'brother'",
          "to": "Svan ჯჷმილ ǯəmil"
        },
        {
          "from": "Proto-Kartvelian *ʒ₁arɣw- 'vein'",
          "to": "Svan ჯა̈რღუ̂ ǯärɣû"
        },
        {
          "from": "Proto-Kartvelian *brʒ₁- 'to battle, struggle' (Old Georgian ბრძოლაჲ brʒolay)",
          "to": "Svan ლიბურჯიე̄ლ liburǯiēl, Mingrelian ბურჯაფი burǯapi",
          "note": "Svan has two reflexes of *ʒ₁: ǯ in these roots and ž in others (*ʒ₁aɣl- > ჟეღ žeɣ 'dog'), which are excluded here."
        }
      ]
    }
